# Build context for the RAG app image is THIS directory (Module_04_rag), not
# rag-starter — the app imports the sibling `harness/` package, which lives here
# one level up from rag-starter. Keep the context lean: drop venvs, node_modules,
# caches, secrets, and the experiment/scratch dirs that never belong in the image.
rag-starter/.venv
rag-starter/frontend/node_modules
rag-starter/.streamlit/secrets.toml
rag-starter/experiments
rag-starter/mockups
rag-starter/todo
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
**/._*
